{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "frn4le12ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Amanda, j'ai un petit probl\u00e8me et j'ai besoin de tes suggestions. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span> : Qu'est-ce qui se passe ?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Alors... ma s\u0153ur se marie ce week-end.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span> : Super ! Toutes mes f\u00e9licitations !</br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "frn4le12ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Merci. Le probl\u00e8me, c'est que la c\u00e9r\u00e9monie a lieu en Provence, et je viens de me rendre compte qu'il n'y a pas de vols pour Marseille samedi matin.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span> : Mince ! Est-ce que \u00e7a veut dire que tu dois t'absenter du boulot et partir vendredi ? Nous avons notre r\u00e9union hebdomadaire, et nous devons pr\u00e9senter notre \u00e9tude de march\u00e9 pour nos clients.</br>", "id": 2, "time": "11500", "image": "frn4le12ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : \tJe sais. C'est pour \u00e7a que je devrais envoyer un courriel \u00e0 M. Tremblay.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span> : Oui. Tu pourrais lui dire o\u00f9 tu en es et lui expliquer que tu as termin\u00e9 ta part de l'\u00e9tude. Je peux lui montrer ton dossier sur le programme de sensibilisation.</br>", "id": 3, "time": "29250", "image": "frn4le12ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Oui, c'est vrai. Merci !</br><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span> : Tu devrais peut-\u00eatre insister sur le fait que cette absence est impr\u00e9vue et que tu es d\u00e9sol\u00e9 de cet inconv\u00e9nient ?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Bonne id\u00e9e. Je pourrais aussi sugg\u00e9rer de faire des heures suppl\u00e9mentaires lundi.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span> : Bien vu ! Allez, bon courage !</br>", "id": 4, "time": "43250", "image": "frn4le12ob08re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "frn4le12ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn4le12ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "frn4le12ob08re3img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<ul> <li>Comment \u00e9crire un courriel formel</li></ul>", "id": 1, "time": "4500", "image": "frn4le12ob08re3img02.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 2, "time": "7250", "image": "frn4le12ob08re3img03.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 3, "time": "22500", "image": "frn4le12ob08re3img04.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 4, "time": "31500", "image": "frn4le12ob08re3img05.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 5, "time": "36000", "image": "frn4le12ob08re3img06.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 6, "time": "42500", "image": "frn4le12ob08re3img07.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 7, "time": "45000", "image": "frn4le12ob08re3img08.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 8, "time": "50000", "image": "frn4le12ob08re3img09.jpg"}, {"text": "<ul><li>Le courriel de Pierre</li></ul>", "id": 9, "time": "55500", "image": "frn4le12ob08re3img10.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "frn4le12ob08re3aud01", "coverimg": "frn4le12ob08re3img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux \u00e9crire un courriel professionnel. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux produire un texte sur les activit\u00e9s quotidiennes du travail. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux demander et faire des suggestions par \u00e9crit.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Est-ce que vous \u00e9crivez souvent des courriels professionnels&nbsp;? \u00c0 qui sont-ils destin\u00e9s g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "De quoi parlez-vous dans ce genre de courriels&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Coin r\u00e9daction : Pierre doit envoyer un courriel \u00e0 son sup\u00e9rieur.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Pierre doit s'absenter du travail parce que sa s\u0153ur se marie. Peut-il faire des <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">heures sup</span> pour rattraper le temps perdu ? ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Consignes : Appuyez sur le bouton pour \u00e9couter l'enregistrement audio.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\"Heures sup\"</span> est une forme courte et populaire d'<span class=\"italic\">heures suppl\u00e9mentaires.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}], "type": "STI", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "stimuli_ids": [3], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Sujet : demande de cong\u00e9 urgent - Vendredi 12 octobre", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Cher Monsieur Tremblay,", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 1}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Je vous \u00e9cris pour vous faire part de ma demande de prise de cong\u00e9 vendredi 12 octobre.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 2}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Je dois m'absenter pour quelques jours en raison du mariage de ma s\u0153ur. ", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 3}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "J'ai cherch\u00e9 \u00e0 trouver un vol samedi matin mais il n'y en a malheureusement aucun \u00e0 destination de Marseille. ", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 4}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Je me vois dans l'obligation de prendre le reste du vendredi apr\u00e8s-midi. ", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 5}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Je suis bien entendu d\u00e9sol\u00e9 de cet inconv\u00e9nient. Ce n'est pas mon habitude de prendre des absences impr\u00e9vues, et je m'en excuse. ", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 6}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "J'ai fait en sorte de terminer ma part de l'\u00e9tude de march\u00e9 pour nos clients, et Amanda a acc\u00e8s au reste du dossier sur le programme de sensibilisation sur lequel nous travaillons.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 7}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Je serai de retour dimanche soir. Je suis tout \u00e0 fait dispos\u00e9 \u00e0 faire des heures suppl\u00e9mentaires lundi pour rattraper tout \u00e9ventuel retard.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 8}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Dans l'attente de votre r\u00e9ponse, veuillez agr\u00e9er mes salutations distingu\u00e9es.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 9}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "Cordialement,   Pierre Dupont.\f", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 10}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Pierre \u00e9crit un courriel \u00e0 M. Tremblay.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "  Parfait ! ", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Quelque chose ne va pas. Essayez encore une fois !", "type": "text"}, {"content": "La prochaine fois peut-\u00eatre.", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"content": [], "type": "tips"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Consignes : Regardez l'enregistrement vid\u00e9o. D\u00e9placez les phrases verticalement <span class=\"sena-icon sena-icon-vertical-drag\"></span> pour les mettre dans le bon ordre. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Vous avez deux essais pour soumettre vos r\u00e9ponses.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": 2, "type": "template_override"}], "type": "MT1", "template_override": 2}, {"id": 3, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Sujet :", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 1}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Salutation :", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 2}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Paragraphe : ", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 3}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Phrase de cl\u00f4ture et formule de politesse :", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 4}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Nom : ", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_3", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 5}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\"> \u00c0 votre tour d'\u00e9crire un courriel comme Pierre !</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Consignes : <br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Imaginez que vous devez \u00e9crire un courriel \u00e0 votre directeur. Vous devez vous absenter du travail pour le mariage de votre fr\u00e8re.</span> <br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Employez un langage formel. </span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">N'oubliez pas d'inclure : <ul><li> L'objet<br /><li>Une salutation appropri\u00e9e<br /> <li>Les informations essentielles<br /><li>Une phrase de cl\u00f4ture</li></ul></span>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Lorsque vous avez termin\u00e9 votre courriel professionnel, appuyez sur le bouton <span class=\"strong\">Allez \u00e0 l'exercice \u00e9crit</span> .</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Courriel professionnel</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Vous avez fini !", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " <span class=\"strong\">R\u00e9visez votre courriel professionnel.</span> <br/>\nLorsque vous \u00e9crivez un courriel professionnel :", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Employez un langage formel</li> <li>N'oubliez pas les formules de politesse</li> <li>Relisez votre courriel avant de l'envoyer \u00e0 votre patron !</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez le courriel \u00e0 voix haute \u00e0 un camarade.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Appuyez sur <span class=\"strong\">Soumettre</span> pour sauver votre travail.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"grading_contents": {"header": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 5, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}]}, "body": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": [" "], "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": [" "], "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": [" "], "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": [" "], "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": [" "], "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": [" "], "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": [" "], "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": [" "], "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": [" "], "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type":